Package: Dynamix
Type: Package
Title: Chromatin Stripe Calling Pipeline using a Bayesian NDLM
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Soomin Han
Maintainer: Soomin Han <hsm0511@snu.ac.kr>
Description: Dynamix identifies chromatin stripes from Hi-C contact files by applying a Bayesian Dynamic Linear Model (NDLM) to signal probability matrices. The signal probability matrices are constructed using a zero-inflated negative binomial and negative binomial (ZINB+NB) mixture expectation-maximization (EM) algorithm.
License: GPL-3
LazyData: true
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: dplyr, tibble, tidyr, reticulate, data.table, BiocGenerics, Biostrings, GenomicRanges, GenomeInfoDb, IRanges, rtracklayer, BSgenome, rlang, methods, readr, MASS, splines
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
